<div class="content-block">
  <div class="section-head">Meeting Summary</div>
  <div class="summary-intro">
    The May 2025 meeting was the longest of the year, encompassing formal adoption of the FY2026 operating budget ($58.2M, up 4.1% from FY2025), the annual closed-session evaluation of Superintendent Dr. Sara Syphers, and first reading of a revised middle school math curriculum adoption. The budget passed 6–1 after nearly 90 minutes of public comment from 22 speakers. The board returned from executive session to announce it had voted unanimously to renew the superintendent's contract for two additional years.
  </div>
  <div>
    <span class="highlight-pill">📋 Budget: $58.2M adopted</span>
    <span class="highlight-pill">👤 Superintendent renewed 2 yrs</span>
    <span class="highlight-pill">📚 MS Math curriculum — 1st reading</span>
    <span class="highlight-pill">22 public speakers</span>
  </div>
</div>

